  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "33-66",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> FAQ </h1>",
      "body": "<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c1751",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "What tools can I measure with the ZOLLER »hobCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« universal measuring machine can measure and adjust a wide variety of tools, such as hob cutters, tap drills, end mills, step drills, and form tools.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1748",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What types of gear cutting tools can I measure with the »hobCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« provides highly accurate measurements that are performed in accordance with relevant standards such as DIN 3968 and DIN 1829.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1746",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How long does it take to perform a full measurement of a tool?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>A complete measurement of a hob cutter in accordance with DIN 3968 usually takes only a few minutes. Data entry for a new tool is required only once and is also very quick.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1744",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What are the advantages of the integrated measuring sensor?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The measuring sensor makes it possible to measure parameters that remain hidden from the camera, such as the rake angle, pitch, and cutting groove direction. This is especially useful for re-sharpeners.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1742",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How is the evaluation of the measurement results performed?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The measurement results are automatically evaluated in accordance with the relevant standards, and a detailed log with graphic elements is generated.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1740",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How does automation work with »hobCheck«?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« can be used in combination with the »roboSet 2« automation solution. This allows tools to be loaded, measured, sorted, and documented fully automatically—around the clock and without an operator.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1738",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What interfaces does the ZOLLER »hobCheck« offer?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The »hobCheck« features open data interfaces for transferring measurement data directly to CAD/CAM systems, grinding machines, and tool management software. This enables end-to-end digitization of the processes.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1736",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How are the measurement results documented?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>All measurement results are documented in detail and can be provided to customers as inspection reports. This ensures that the quality of the tools can be fully verified.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1734",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "What benefits does »hobCheck« offer to grinding shops?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For grinding shops, »hobCheck« enables fully automatic and precise measurement of grinding wheels. This helps reduce setup costs and optimize tool life.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1732",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How is »hobCheck« integrated into the manufacturing process?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»hobCheck« can be integrated directly into manufacturing processes. This allows tool data to be imported from CAD/CAM systems and used to perform nominal/actual comparisons for optimized grinding process control.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "text",
          "id": "c1730",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1750",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ]
